    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilahīlo kūlwa banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūngalūngaga nabo a Baisilseli ūbawīle gīkī, “Ūlū munhū ūfunya sabo ha ng'wanya gwa banhū balebe, abo walahīla kūbatūūla kūlī SEEBA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tūūlaga mpango, ū ngosha wa myaka ya kwandīja makūmi a bīlī kūshisha myaka makūmi atandatū, abize na mpango gwa shekeeli makūmi atanò ja feza, kūlenganīla nī shekeeli ya ng'wipandī lyeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū nkīma ntūūlīlage mpango gwa shekeeli mkūmi adatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū wa myaka ya kwandīja ha ītanò kūshisha makūmi abīlī, ū ngosha ntūūlīlage mpango gwa shekeeli makūmi abīlī; ūlū nkīma shekeeli ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wa kwandīja ng'weji gūmò kūshisha myaka ītanò, ū ngosha ntūūlīlage mpango gwa shekeeli itanò ja feza, ūlū nkīma shekeeli idatū ja feza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū alī na myaka ya kwandīja makūmi atandatū na kūja kwigūlya, ū mpango gwa ngosha gūtūūlage ha shekeeli ikūmi na itanò, ū mpango gwa nkīma gūbize shekeeli ikūmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūlū ng'habī no no no, ūbiza atī na būdūla wa kūpandīka sabo ya kūlenganīla nū mpango ūyo gūtūūlilwe, ūkūng'wenha ū munhū ng'wenūyo kūlī ngabīji. Ū ngabīji akūntūūlīla we ū mpango kūlenganīla nū būdūla wa munhū ūyo alīfunya ī shilahīlo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlahīla kūlwa mitugo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūlū ūfunya shilahīlo kūlwa ntugo ū mu mitugo ījo jizunīlījiwe gīkī jiigeleelilwe kūfunyiwa shitambò kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ū ntugo gwa mbika yenīyo ūlū gūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, yenīyo yabizaga sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atizūgema kūgūkaabanya nūūlū kūtūūla gūngī a ha ng'wanya gwago; gīkī hīmba ntugo gwawiza ha ng'wanya gwa ntugo gwabūbi, nūūlū ntugo gwabūbi ha ng'wanya gwa ntugo gwawiza. Ūlū wīta būkaabanya wa kūtūūla ntugo ha ng'wanya gwa ntugo gūngī, ī jose būbīlī wajo jikūbiza ja ng'wa SEEBA, ūyo gwalī gwafunyiagwa, nū yūyo gūlatūūlwe a ha ng'wanya gwago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbiza walahīlaga kūgūfunya ntugo ūyo gūtazunīlījiwe kūfunyiwa shitambò kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, shiigelile gwenhwe kūlī ngabīji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji hū g'wene akūfunya ū būlamuji wa ntugo gwenūyo kūlenganīla nū wiza wago nūūlū ū būbi wago. Na lūūlū ū mpango ūyo alagūhele ū ngabīji, hū gwene gūkūbiza gwa ntugo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenekīlī ntugo ūlū ūkooba kūgūkomoola, akongeja īmò ya itanò ya mpango gwago.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilahīlo kūlwa numba na malaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū munhū ūfunya numba yakwe gīkī yabizaga ya ng'wa SEEBA, ū ngabīji akwīlola alamule kūlenganīla nū wiza nū būbi wayo. Ū mpango ūyo alagūtūūle ū ngabīji hū gwene ūyo gūkūbiza gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ūyo wayīfunyaga ī numba yenīyo ūlū ūhaya kwīkomoola, īkūng'wigeleela afunyī īmò y'itanò ya mpango gwayo, hūna ī numba yenīyo īkūbiza yakwe hangī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū munhū ūtīna ilaale lya lūganda lwa ng'wawe, ūlīfunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ū mpango gwalyo shiigelile gūtūūlwe kūlenganīla nū wingī wa mbīyū ījo jiigelile kūhamva mo. Shekeeli makūmi atano ja feza kū būlī homeeli ya mbīyū ja shayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūlīfunya ī lilaale lyakwe mu ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo, ū mpango ūyo gwatūūlagwa gūkwikala gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ūlīfunya ī lilaale lyakwe hanuma ya ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo, ū ngabīji akūgūhela ū mpango gwalyo kūlenganīla nī myaka īyo yasaagile ū kūshika ū kū ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo ūyo gūlī kū būtongi, hūna ūgūtūūla ū mpango gwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū munhū ūyo walīfunije ī lilaale lyenīlo ūlū ūhaya kūlīkomoola, īkūng'wigeleelwa afunyī īmò ya itanò ya mpango gwalyo, hūna līkūbiza lyakwe hangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ūlū ūbiza atatogilwe ū kūlīkomoola ī lilaale lyakwe, nūūlū ūbiza walījingije kūlī munhū ūngī hangī, lītīīko kūkomoolwa ī lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo ūlū lyūbiza mu wiyaabī, līkūbiza sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA, līkūbiza sawa na gīkī lyafunyiagwa kūlwa nguno yakwe; līkūbiza lya bagabīji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū ūfunya kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA ilaale īlo walīgūlile, īlo lītī sabo ya lūganda lwa ng'wawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūlīhelela ū mpango gwalyo kūlenganīla nī myaka ya kūshika ha ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo, hūna ū lūshikū lwenūlo, ū munhū ng'wenūyo akūlīfunīja ī sabo kūlenganīla nū mpango gwalyo, gītī shikolo īsho shibalilwe kūbiza sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ng'waka gwa kūshosha shikolo ī lilaale lyenīlo līkūnshokela ū munhū ūyo walī ng'wenekīlī a ha kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī mpango gwa shikolo gūkūtūūlwa kūlenganīla na shekeeli ya ng'wipandī lyeela; gulaamu ikūmi būlī shekeeli īmò.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shikolo sha ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
