        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Būlī zaka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Zaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mhayo ūyo gūkatūmamīlagwa mu Bibilia kwīhaya īmò y'ikūmi ya shikolo shose shose; ī zaka ya shikolo īlī sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ya shikolo shose shose sha kūfuma mu migūnda, īlī sabo ya ng'wa Seeba; jibize mbīyū ja kūfuma ng'wilaale nūūlū matwajo ga mitī; ī shose shilī sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūkomoola zaka yakwe yose yose, shiigelile ongeje īmò y'itanò ya mpango gwa shikolo shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī zaka ya mu madaale ga mitugo, jibize ng'ombe nūūlū ng'holo, īlī sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA; a h'ikanza lya kūsoloojiwa mitugo, būlī ntugo gw'ikūmi ū mu mitugo jose gūkūbalwa kūbiza sabo ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nsolooja ītang'wigeleelilwe kūyūsolanhya ī jawiza kūfuma ū mu jabūbi, yaya nūūlū kūyūkaabanya. Ūlū ūkaabanya, ī jose būbīlī wajo, īyo yalī yabalagwa nī yīyo wayenheelaga ho, jikūbiza ja ng'wa SEEBA; jitī ja kūkomoolwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi hū shilagīlo īsho SEEBA akang'winha Musa mu lūgūlū lwa Sinai kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
